{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"28日29日4公演"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in六本木ブルーシアター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと初日の昼公演で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喉が潰れるという最悪な事態に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自覚の足りない今の自分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったく、本当に情けない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハでも本番直前までも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"散々メンバーに迷惑かけていたのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことになってしまい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に悔しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご心配おかけしてしまい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛治療中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セットリストはまだ公開できませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名物のユニット曲は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やさしさとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でこぴん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を歌いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう帰ってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルコント傑作選では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の昼に「銀行強盗」を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん、純奈、きいちゃん、琴子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と披露しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は強盗役で自由に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やらせてもらって楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来た方、どうだったかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/07/01/4082959/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連続4公演で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えたものがたくさんある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ続くライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一公演一公演大切に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半もみんなでがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/07/01/4082959/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由MV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな朝食を食べる斬新なMVです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜中見たらだめだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回に引き続きセンターを務めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブでも披露しましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもカッコ良いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは違った雰囲気で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブで歌うときも、ぴりっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"締まるのではないかなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もうひとつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のおに魂で解禁された"},{"type":"break"},{"typ